0.1
# Scale factor for tilt mode (double)
0.1
# Scale factor for focus mode (double)
0.0002
# Gain for focus sliding average (double)
0.0002
# RMS value (double)
14
# Threshold value for pixel (double)
50
# Threshold value for total counts (double)
0
# Angle in radians between M2 and PWFS1 (double)
3.14159
# Angle in radians between M1 and PWFS1 (double)
3.14159
